exports[`renders all checks and retains an uncertain start identity without sending again (Chinese: false) 1`] = `"CheckResultCodeMeasured scope and limitsNode carrierSKIPPED / SETTLEDNOT_SELECTEDActual Electron Node-mode process and executable observation; no signature or SHA qualification.Runtime filesSKIPPED / SETTLEDNOT_SELECTEDInstalled production/resource inventory is unavailable.Loaded modulesSKIPPED / SETTLEDNOT_SELECTEDActual installed Host/Client inventory is unavailable.Electron rendererSKIPPED / SETTLEDNOT_SELECTEDActual window, preload and local protocol require carrier evidence.Atomic storageSKIPPED / SETTLEDNOT_SELECTEDIsolated UTF-8 write, replace, cold read and actual native quota refusal.ShellSKIPPED / SETTLEDNOT_SELECTEDFixed native command and independent file read under current execution policy.SkillsSKIPPED / SETTLEDNOT_SELECTEDOfficial filesystem provider loads only one explicit synthetic root; default roots disabled.Action trustSKIPPED / SETTLEDNOT_SELECTEDThe real action executor refuses an untrusted synthetic action.Action runSKIPPED / SETTLEDNOT_SELECTEDFixed action, cold journal read and actual parsed isolated TAP log; user source coverage is unknown.Action changeSKIPPED / SETTLEDNOT_SELECTEDChanged synthetic configuration invalidates its old trust at execution.CancellationSKIPPED / SETTLEDNOT_SELECTEDCancel an actually started long command and await process/output drain; timeout is separate.GitSKIPPED / SETTLEDNOT_SELECTEDFresh isolated repository, local baseline and independent changed-file comparison; no user Git config.MercurialSKIPPED / SETTLEDNOT_SELECTEDFresh isolated repository and local comparison; a missing executable is skipped.Artifact changesSKIPPED / SETTLEDNOT_SELECTEDChanged synthetic bytes invalidate the real artifact lease reader.Durable prefixSKIPPED / SETTLEDNOT_SELECTEDRaw append/replacement, physical restore refusal, committed Notebook and prepared route/cache-hint classification; provider cache hits remain unqualified.Cold recoverySKIPPED / SETTLEDNOT_SELECTEDRead an unsettled synthetic checkpoint as INTERRUPTED/UNKNOWN without disk edits or replay; does not kill this Host.Notification identitySKIPPED / SETTLEDNOT_SELECTEDPrivate actual receipt/notice owner deduplication; system display is disabled.Local provider failureSKIPPED / SETTLEDNOT_SELECTEDOfficial preparation refuses locally before payload or send and stops later preparation; no real model or streaming retry measured.ConnectionSKIPPED / SETTLEDNOT_SELECTEDOne logged synthetic request on the confirmed model and real connection/HTTP revisions; local mode sends none.StreamingSKIPPED / SETTLEDNOT_SELECTEDActual deltas and successful finish of the first request; no request in local mode.Tool protocolSKIPPED / SETTLEDNOT_SELECTEDObserve only the fixed echo tool and arguments; execute no model-generated commands.Cache countersSKIPPED / SETTLEDNOT_SELECTEDOnly actually reported cache usage qualifies; absent counters remain UNKNOWN.Repeated cacheSKIPPED / SETTLEDNOT_SELECTEDTwo 2-KiB groups repeated twice within the same five-request budget; actual positive cache read required.Native field acceptanceUNKNOWN / SETTLEDFIELD_UNVERIFIEDActual window, notification, monitors, sleep and abnormal recovery require target-device evidence.Network field acceptanceUNKNOWN / SETTLEDFIELD_UNVERIFIEDApplication HTTP policy does not qualify Shell/Git/sockets/workers or global zero-egress."`;

exports[`renders all checks and retains an uncertain start identity without sending again (Chinese: true) 1`] = `"检查结果代码测量范围与限制Node 载体SKIPPED / SETTLEDNOT_SELECTED观察实际 Electron Node-mode 进程与可执行文件，不证明签名或 SHA 完整性。运行时文件SKIPPED / SETTLEDNOT_SELECTED尚无实际安装生产依赖与资源清单。已加载模块SKIPPED / SETTLEDNOT_SELECTED尚无实际安装 Host/Client 清单。Electron 窗口SKIPPED / SETTLEDNOT_SELECTED实际窗口、预加载与本地协议仍需载体证据。原子存储SKIPPED / SETTLEDNOT_SELECTED隔离 UTF-8 写入、替换、冷读与真实原生配额拒绝。ShellSKIPPED / SETTLEDNOT_SELECTED依当前执行权限运行固定原生命令，并独立读回合成文件。SkillsSKIPPED / SETTLEDNOT_SELECTED官方文件系统 provider 只加载显式合成目录，禁用默认目录。动作信任SKIPPED / SETTLEDNOT_SELECTED真实执行入口拒绝未信任合成操作。动作执行SKIPPED / SETTLEDNOT_SELECTED固定操作、冷读 journal 与实际隔离 TAP 日志解析；用户源码覆盖仍未知。动作变更SKIPPED / SETTLEDNOT_SELECTED合成配置改变后，原信任在执行入口失效。取消SKIPPED / SETTLEDNOT_SELECTED取消已实际启动的长命令并等待进程与输出排空，超时单列。GitSKIPPED / SETTLEDNOT_SELECTED新隔离仓库、本地基线与实际修改比较，不读取用户 Git 配置。MercurialSKIPPED / SETTLEDNOT_SELECTED新隔离仓库与本地比较，缺少可执行文件时跳过。产物变化SKIPPED / SETTLEDNOT_SELECTED合成字节变化后，真实产物租约读取入口拒绝旧引用。持久前缀SKIPPED / SETTLEDNOT_SELECTED测量原文追加／替换、物理恢复拒绝、已提交 Notebook 与准备路由／缓存键分类；提供方缓存命中仍未认证。中断冷读SKIPPED / SETTLEDNOT_SELECTED未终结合成检查点只读为 INTERRUPTED/UNKNOWN，不改磁盘或重放，不故意杀当前 Host。通知身份SKIPPED / SETTLEDNOT_SELECTED私有真实回执/通知 owner 去重，禁用系统弹出。本地 provider 失败SKIPPED / SETTLEDNOT_SELECTED官方准备入口在正文和发送前本地拒绝，停止后续准备；不测真实模型或流式重试。连接SKIPPED / SETTLEDNOT_SELECTED依已确认模型、真实连接及 HTTP 修订发送一次已记录合成请求；本机模式零请求。流式输出SKIPPED / SETTLEDNOT_SELECTED首请求的实际增量及成功 finish；本机模式不发送请求。工具协议SKIPPED / SETTLEDNOT_SELECTED仅观察固定 echo 工具和参数，不执行模型生成命令。缓存计数SKIPPED / SETTLEDNOT_SELECTED仅实际报告的缓存计数取得资格，缺失保持 UNKNOWN。重复缓存SKIPPED / SETTLEDNOT_SELECTED两组 2 KiB 输入各重复两次，共享五次请求预算，实际正 cache read 才 PASS。原生现场验收UNKNOWN / SETTLEDFIELD_UNVERIFIED实际窗口、通知、跨屏、休眠和异常恢复需要目标设备证据。网络现场验收UNKNOWN / SETTLEDFIELD_UNVERIFIED应用 HTTP 策略不证明 Shell/Git/socket/worker 或系统全局零外联。"`;
